@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Alle orders ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders

### Order bij ID ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1

### Alle order items ophalen bij een order ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/items

### Alle orders ophalen bij een client ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/client/1

### Create een order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientId": 1,
    "orderDate": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
    "requestDate": "2026-11-20T10:00:00Z",
    "reference": "Idk",
    "customerPoNumber": "Idk",
    "orderStatus": "Idk",
    "shippingNotes": "Idk",
    "warehouseId": 1,
    "shipToClientId": 1,
    "billToClientId": 1
}

### Update een order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "clientId": 1,
    "orderDate": "2026-11-15T10:00:00Z",
    "requestDate": "2026-11-20T10:00:00Z",
    "reference": "Idk",
    "customerPoNumber": "Idk",
    "orderStatus": "Idk",
    "shippingNotes": "Idk",
    "warehouseId": 1,
    "shipToClientId": 1,
    "billToClientId": 1
}

### Update alle order items binnen een order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1/items
Content-Type: application/json

[
    {
        "itemId": 1,
        "amount": 5
    },
    {
        "itemId": 2,
        "amount": 3
    }
]

### Order verwijderen
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/1